         is still the supported route on WP8.1 Silverlight. -->
    <!--
      Opus, as a pure managed port of libopus. Windows Phone 8.1 has no Opus
      support of any kind, and the codec is far too large to write by hand - it
      is a hybrid of two codecs, where AES and inflate were single algorithms.
      The portable build targets a profile that includes Windows Phone
      Silverlight, so it drops straight in. BSD licensed; see Lib\README.md.
    -->
    <Reference Include="Concentus">
